SUMMARY:Sheba's Speakeasy Comedy Club LIVE at The Three Monkeys
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nSheba’s Speakeasy Comedy Club at The Three Monkeys in midtown Manhattan features a wide variety of Comedy Cellar comics who have all been on HBO\, Netflix\, and Comedy Central. Celebrities drop in all the time for this outstanding comedy lineup. \nDine before or during the supper club show — the delicious menu features nachos\, turkey burgers\, ahi tuna\, salads\, quinoa bowls\, sliders\, wings\, and so much more! With tickets priced at only $15\, it’s the most fun\, inexpensive night out whether you’re on a date\, with friends\, or even flying solo! \nEvent Details\nDate: Various dates available (select during purchase)\nTime: 9:30 PM\nDuration: 90 minutes\nLocation: The Three Monkeys\, 832 8th Ave\, New York\, NY 10019\nAge Requirement: 21+ \nAbout the Venue\nThe Three Monkeys is located at 832 8th Avenue in midtown Manhattan. The venue offers a full dinner menu and an impressive selection of 38 unique craft beers\, classy cocktails\, and award-winning wines. \nWhat to Expect\nEnjoy an outstanding comic lineup in a relaxed supper club atmosphere. Sip on craft beers\, cocktails\, or wines while watching top-tier comedians perform. The intimate setting makes every show feel personal and memorable. \nTicket Information\nGeneral Admission tickets are $15.00. No booking fees. Age 21+ required. Dinner menu available before and during the show. \nGet Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/shebas-speakeasy-comedy-club-live-at-the-three-monkeys-2/
LOCATION:The Three Monkeys\, 832 8th Ave\, New York\, NY\, 10019\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://applications-media.feverup.com/image/upload/f_auto,w_720,h_720/fever2/plan/photo/e0301d0c-1a5c-11ee-93b6-aebdd384998d.jpg
