SUMMARY:Gabriel Rutledge LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nGabriel Rutledge is a nationally touring stand-up comedian known for his sharp\, self-aware humor and his ability to find comedy in the most relatable corners of everyday life. Based in the Pacific Northwest\, Rutledge has been a fixture on the comedy club circuit for over 15 years. \nHis comedy style is clean\, clever\, and deeply observational — drawing from his experiences as a husband\, father\, and regular guy navigating a world that never quite makes sense. Gabriel has a natural ease on stage that makes audiences feel like they’re hanging out with a funny friend rather than watching a performance. \nHe has performed at top venues including Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club at MGM Grand in Las Vegas\, Cap City Comedy Club in Austin\, and Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club in San Antonio. His Houston debut at Punch Line is not to be missed. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18+ (2 Beverage Minimum per person)\nTicket Prices: $38 – $50 (fees included)\n\nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Houston is downtown Houston’s top comedy club\, located at 1204 Caroline Street. This Live Nation-operated venue is known for its intimate atmosphere and world-class lineup of national comedians performing year-round. \nThe club’s general admission layout ensures every guest has a great view of the stage\, with preferred seating upgrades available for those who want to be front and center. The full bar and 2-beverage minimum create a lively\, social atmosphere perfect for a Friday night out. \nParking is easy — valet service is available at most shows\, and the Green Street garage on Clay between Main and Fannin offers surface and garage parking with skybridge access. The venue is cashless\, accepting all major credit and debit cards. \nWhat to Expect\nGabriel Rutledge delivers a polished\, crowd-pleasing set that works for everyone from comedy veterans to first-timers. His Friday night early show is the ideal way to kick off the weekend with genuine\, feel-good laughs. \nDoors open at 6:00 PM\, giving you time to settle in and order drinks before the show begins at 7:00 PM. A late show at 9:15 PM is also available. The performance runs approximately 90 minutes. \nSaturday August 22 shows are also available (7:00 PM and 9:15 PM) for those who can’t make Friday. All shows are 18+ with a 2-beverage minimum. No cell phones or recording devices permitted during the performance. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced from $38 to $50 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). Buy official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale options on VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/gabriel-rutledge-live-at-punch-line-houston/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/89e/6396cf7b-d938-4e7f-8c94-6da4ccd7689e_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
