SUMMARY:Josh Blue LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club - Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nJosh Blue LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nEmmy-nominated comedian Josh Blue brings his hilarious stand-up to Punch Line Comedy Club in Sacramento on August 21\, 2026! Winner of NBC’s Last Comic Standing\, Josh Blue is known for his self-deprecating humor about living with cerebral palsy and his fearless\, laugh-out-loud comedy style. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout Josh Blue\nJosh Blue is a stand-up comedian best known for winning Season 4 of NBC’s Last Comic Standing. His comedy centers on his experiences living with cerebral palsy\, delivered with infectious energy and self-deprecating humor that has won over audiences worldwide. He has appeared on numerous TV shows and continues to tour extensively across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nAward-winning stand-up comedy from the winner of Last Comic Standing\nFearless self-deprecating humor and infectious energy\nUnique perspective on life with cerebral palsy\nIntimate club atmosphere at Sacramento’s premier comedy venue\nFull bar service with 2-beverage minimum\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento is located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, CA. One of the top comedy clubs in Northern California\, it features a full bar\, great sightlines\, and ample free parking in the shopping center lot. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $38. This is an 18+ event with a 2-beverage minimum per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-blue-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA\, 95825
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/e27a703c-8764-4c96-9e57-28ece03943d6_RETINA_PORTRAIT_16_9-8UsqGT.jpg
