SUMMARY:Alfred Robles: Vatos with Gatos Tour LIVE at Houston Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Alfred Robles\nAlfred Robles is one of the hottest comedians in the country. After getting kicked out of the police academy\, he rose to become a nationally recognized stand-up star. He was the only comedian featured on all 3 seasons of Stand Up Revolution on Comedy Central\, appeared on Netflix’s Mr. Iglesias\, and was featured on HBO’s Entre Nos. Alfred has toured worldwide with Gabriel Iglesias and was one of the first comedians to perform at Dodger Stadium. \nHis Vatos with Gatos Tour is his biggest headline run yet — a hilarious\, high-energy show packed with his signature storytelling\, crowd work\, and the kind of relatable humor that has earned him a 4.8-star rating from fans across the country. Don’t miss him live in Houston. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM (Late show at 9:45 PM also available)\nVenue: Houston Improv\nAddress: 7620 Katy Freeway #455\, Houston\, TX 77024\nAge Restriction: 18+\nTicket Price: From $79 \nAbout Houston Improv\nHouston Improv is one of Houston’s most beloved comedy clubs\, located at 7620 Katy Freeway inside City Centre. Part of the legendary Improv Comedy Club chain\, it has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy for decades. The club features a full-service bar\, dinner menu\, and an intimate stage setup that puts every seat close to the action. \nThe venue has a lively\, welcoming atmosphere perfect for a night out. With table seating\, great sightlines\, and a two-drink minimum\, it’s the ideal setting for Alfred’s crowd-driven\, high-energy performance style. Parking is available in the City Centre complex. \nWhat to Expect\nAlfred Robles delivers a non-stop laugh fest from start to finish. His shows are known for incredible crowd interaction\, hilarious personal stories\, and a warmth that makes the entire room feel like family. Fans consistently rate his live performances as some of the best comedy experiences they’ve ever had. \nAlfred performs a full weekend run at Houston Improv — Friday Aug 21 at 7:30 PM and 9:45 PM\, Saturday Aug 22 at 7:00 PM and 9:30 PM\, and Sunday Aug 23 at 7:30 PM. This is an 18+ event. \nTicket Information\nPrice: From $79\nTickets available via Ticketmaster/TicketWeb (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/alfred-robles-vatos-with-gatos-tour-live-at-houston-improv/
