DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nDesi Banks LIVE at San Jose Improv\nGet ready for a hilarious night as comedian and social media sensation Desi Banks takes the stage at San Jose Improv on August 21\, 2026. Known for his relatable humor and viral videos\, Desi Banks delivers a high-energy stand-up performance that will have you laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: San Jose Improv\nAddress: 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid photo ID required)\nMinimum Purchase: Two-item minimum per person in showroom \nAbout Desi Banks\nDesi Banks is a comedian\, actor\, and social media personality who has amassed millions of followers with his hilarious character-driven videos and relatable everyday humor. He has toured extensively across the country\, bringing his unique comedic voice to sold-out venues. His stand-up blends storytelling\, impressions\, and sharp observational comedy. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy performance\nHilarious character impressions and storytelling\nRelatable humor about everyday life\nIntimate club atmosphere at San Jose Improv\nFull bar and food service available\nAn unforgettable night of laughs\n\nVenue Information\nSan Jose Improv is located in the heart of downtown San Jose at 62 S Second St. This premier comedy club offers an intimate setting with excellent sightlines and full bar and dining service. The venue is 21+ for this event. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $37. This is a 21+ event — valid photo ID required. All sales are final. Ticket resale is strictly prohibited by the venue. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
