SUMMARY:Russell Peters: RELAX World Tour LIVE at Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nRussell Peters: RELAX World Tour LIVE at Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas\nComedy legend Russell Peters returns to the Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas with his hilarious RELAX World Tour — *It’s Not That Serious — for two exclusive performances on August 21 and 22\, 2026. One of the world’s most successful stand-up comedians\, Peters brings his signature multicultural humor and razor-sharp wit to one of Las Vegas’s most prestigious comedy stages. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026 (also Saturday\, August 22)\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nVenue: Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas\nAddress: 3131 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nAge Requirement: 18+ Event \nAbout Russell Peters\nRussell Peters is one of the most successful stand-up comedians in the world\, known for his sharp multicultural observations and high-energy performances. A Las Vegas resident\, Peters has sold out arenas across six continents and has multiple Netflix specials to his name. His RELAX World Tour continues his tradition of delivering laugh-out-loud comedy that resonates with audiences everywhere. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWorld-class stand-up comedy from a global superstar\nSharp multicultural humor and observational comedy\nHigh-energy performance in an intimate theater setting\nTwo exclusive Las Vegas performances only\nPremium theater experience at the iconic Wynn Las Vegas\nApproximately 90 minutes of entertainment\n\nVenue Information\nThe Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas is one of the most prestigious entertainment venues on the Strip\, known for hosting world-class comedy and music acts in an intimate\, luxurious setting. Located inside the award-winning Wynn Las Vegas resort\, the theater offers exceptional sightlines and premium amenities. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $75 to $150. This is an 18+ event. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). The median ticket price is approximately $126. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/russell-peters-relax-world-tour-live-at-encore-theater-at-wynn-las-vegas/
