DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nKathleen Madigan: Flying Cats & Marching Armadillos Tour LIVE at Music Box at the Borgata\nOne of America’s most beloved stand-up comedians\, Kathleen Madigan\, brings her  LIVE to Music Box at the Borgata in Atlantic City on Friday\, August 21\, 2026 (with a second show Saturday\, August 22). Known for her hilarious storytelling and relatable humor\, Kathleen Madigan is a must-see live performer. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026 (also Saturday\, August 22)Time: 8:00 PM ETVenue: Music Box at the BorgataAddress: One Borgata Way\, Atlantic City\, NJ 08401Doors Open: 7:00 PM \nAbout Kathleen Madigan\nKathleen Madigan is a stand-up comedian with over 30 years of experience and multiple Grammy-nominated comedy albums. Known for her appearances on The Tonight Show\, Late Show with David Letterman\, and her own Netflix specials\, she is one of the most respected voices in stand-up comedy today. \nWhat to Expect\n\nKathleen Madigan’s signature storytelling and observational humor\nHilarious takes on family\, politics\, and everyday life\nAn intimate show at the Music Box at the Borgata\nTwo nights available — August 21 and August 22\nA perfect summer night out in Atlantic City\n\nVenue Information\n \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $59. Get your seats through official Ticketmaster or find resale tickets on VividSeats! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
