SUMMARY:Steve Treviño LIVE at Grand Sierra Resort and Casino
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Steve Treviño\nSteve Treviño is one of the hottest stand-up comedians in the country\, celebrated for his relatable\, family-friendly humor rooted in his Mexican-American upbringing in South Texas. His comedy resonates deeply with audiences across all backgrounds\, blending sharp cultural observations with heartfelt storytelling. \nTreviño has released multiple comedy specials\, including Relatable\, Til Death\, Grandpa Joe’s Son\, and Steve Treviño: Adulting\, all of which have earned him a massive and loyal fanbase. His specials are available on major streaming platforms and have been praised for their warmth\, authenticity\, and laugh-out-loud humor. \nKnown for his stories about marriage\, family\, and growing up Latino in America\, Steve Treviño brings a unique voice to the comedy world that is both hilarious and deeply human. Fans can expect a high-energy performance filled with personal anecdotes\, crowd interaction\, and the kind of comedy that makes you laugh until your sides hurt. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open approximately 7:00 PM) \nVenue: Grand Sierra Resort and Casino (Grand Theatre) — 2500 East Second Street\, Reno\, NV 89595 \nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes \nAge Restriction: All ages welcome; some adult content — parental discretion advised \nAbout the Venue\nThe Grand Theatre at Grand Sierra Resort is Reno’s premier destination for world-class entertainment. Located at 2500 East Second Street\, the Grand Sierra Resort and Casino is one of the largest resort properties in Northern Nevada\, offering a full entertainment complex with a hotel\, casino\, restaurants\, and live event spaces. \nThe Grand Theatre seats approximately 1\,600 guests and is known for its intimate atmosphere\, excellent acoustics\, and comfortable seating. The venue has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy\, music\, and entertainment\, making it one of the most sought-after performance spaces in the Reno-Tahoe region. \nAmple parking is available on-site at the Grand Sierra Resort\, and the venue is conveniently located just minutes from downtown Reno and the Reno-Tahoe International Airport. Guests are encouraged to arrive early to enjoy the resort’s dining and casino amenities before the show. \nWhat to Expect\nSteve Treviño’s live show is a solo stand-up performance packed with his signature blend of family humor\, cultural comedy\, and personal storytelling. Expect a warm\, engaging performance that connects with audiences of all ages and backgrounds. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes with no intermission. Steve Treviño is known for his ability to work the crowd and make every audience member feel like part of the show. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discovering him for the first time\, this is a night of comedy you won’t forget. \nPlan to arrive at least 30 minutes before showtime to find your seats and settle in. The Grand Theatre fills up quickly for popular comedy events\, so early arrival is recommended. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $54 – $80 (prices may vary; check current listings for availability) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale marketplace). Secure your seats early as this show is expected to sell out. \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/steve-trevino-live-at-grand-sierra-resort-and-casino/
LOCATION:Grand Sierra Resort and Casino\, 2500 East Second Street\, Reno\, NV\, 89595\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/a99/e2b2556c-a78f-4cb3-842e-730396125a99_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
