SUMMARY:For You Fest: GenX Takeover Comedy Tour LIVE at Great Cedar Showroom at Foxwoods Resort Casino
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nFor You Fest: GenX Takeover Comedy Tour LIVE at Great Cedar Showroom at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nThe GenX Takeover Comedy Tour is bringing a powerhouse lineup of comedians to the Great Cedar Showroom at Foxwoods Resort Casino for one unforgettable night on August 21\, 2026. This special “For You Fest” edition celebrates Gen X humor with a roster of hilarious performers who know exactly how to make a crowd roar with laughter. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Great Cedar Showroom at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nAddress: 39 Norwich Westerly Road\, Mashantucket\, CT 06339\nParking: On-site parking available at no charge\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome (under 14 must be accompanied by an adult) \nAbout GenX Takeover Comedy Tour\nThe GenX Takeover Comedy Tour is a touring comedy showcase celebrating the humor\, nostalgia\, and irreverence of Generation X. Featuring a rotating cast of top comedians including Justin Rupple\, Kelly Manno\, Jojo Malagar\, The Dadbod Veteran\, and more\, this tour has been selling out venues across the country. The “For You Fest” edition at Foxwoods is a special one-night-only event packed with laughs. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of stand-up comedy from multiple Gen X comedians\nSharp\, relatable humor about growing up in the 70s\, 80s\, and 90s\nA high-energy show in the intimate Great Cedar Showroom setting\nWorld-class casino resort amenities before and after the show\nOne-night-only special “For You Fest” format\nTickets starting from $61 — great value for a multi-comedian lineup\n\nVenue Information\nThe Great Cedar Showroom at Foxwoods Resort Casino is one of New England’s premier entertainment venues\, located in Mashantucket\, CT. The intimate showroom offers excellent sightlines and top-notch sound\, making it a favorite for comedy and live entertainment. Foxwoods offers world-class dining\, gaming\, and hotel accommodations on-site. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $61 and are available now. This is a one-night-only event — don’t miss your chance to see the GenX Takeover Comedy Tour live at Foxwoods. Grab your seats before they sell out! \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/for-you-fest-genx-takeover-comedy-tour-live-at-great-cedar-showroom-at-foxwoods-resort-casino/
