SUMMARY:Leanne Morgan: THE TIME OF OUR LIVES TOUR LIVE at The Orpheum Theatre Memphis (Saturday)
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nLeanne Morgan is one of the hottest names in stand-up comedy\, beloved for her warm\, Southern charm and hilariously relatable humor about marriage\, motherhood\, and middle age. The Tennessee native has taken the comedy world by storm with her authentic\, feel-good style. \nMorgan’s Netflix special and viral social media presence have earned her a massive\, devoted fanbase. Her comedy resonates especially with women who see their own lives reflected in her stories — but her universal appeal brings in audiences of all backgrounds. \nThe Time of Our Lives Tour features all-new material and marks a triumphant return to Memphis\, where Morgan has previously sold out shows. This is a three-night run at the Orpheum — don’t miss your chance to see her live! \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 22\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM CDT \nVenue: The Orpheum Theatre Memphis\, 203 S. Main St.\, Memphis\, TN 38103 \nNote: This is the Saturday night performance. Friday (Aug 21) and Sunday (Aug 23) shows are also available. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Orpheum Theatre Memphis is one of the most storied and beautiful performing arts venues in the American South. Built in 1928\, this stunning historic theater seats approximately 2\,300 guests and is renowned for its ornate architecture\, crystal chandeliers\, and exceptional acoustics. \nLocated at 203 S. Main Street in the heart of downtown Memphis\, the Orpheum is steps away from Beale Street and the city’s vibrant entertainment district. The venue offers orchestra\, mezzanine\, and balcony seating\, with excellent sightlines throughout. \nParking is available in nearby garages and surface lots. The Orpheum’s intimate atmosphere makes it one of the best places in Memphis to experience live comedy — close enough to feel every punchline. \nWhat to Expect\nLeanne Morgan performs a solo stand-up set featuring all-new material from The Time of Our Lives Tour. The show is family-friendly and runs approximately 75–90 minutes. \nMorgan’s performances are known for their warmth\, laughter\, and the feeling that you’re spending an evening with your funniest friend. Expect a joyful\, feel-good night that will have you laughing from start to finish. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: From $123 and up (fees may apply) \nPurchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/leanne-morgan-the-time-of-our-lives-tour-live-at-the-orpheum-theatre-memphis-saturday/
