SUMMARY:Ben Palmer LIVE at The Bell House
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets \nResale Tickets \nBen Palmer LIVE at The Bell House\nComedian Ben Palmer takes the stage at The Bell House in Brooklyn\, New York on Saturday\, August 22\, 2026 for a night of stand-up comedy. Known for his clever wit and engaging stage presence\, Ben Palmer delivers a show that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. Don’t miss this live comedy performance at one of Brooklyn’s most beloved venues! \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 22\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM\nVenue: The Bell House\nAddress: 149 7th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215\nParking: Street parking available; nearby paid lots\nAge Requirement: 18+ (valid photo ID required) \nAbout Ben Palmer\nBen Palmer is a stand-up comedian known for his sharp observational humor and charismatic stage presence. He has performed at comedy clubs and venues across the country\, building a loyal fanbase with his relatable and entertaining style. Ben Palmer’s live shows are known for their energy\, wit\, and crowd interaction that keeps audiences engaged throughout the night. \nWhat to Expect\n\nBen Palmer’s sharp\, witty stand-up comedy\nObservational humor and engaging crowd interaction\nAn intimate Brooklyn venue experience at The Bell House\nA fun Saturday night out in Brooklyn\nNon-stop laughs in a welcoming\, laid-back atmosphere\n\nVenue Information\nThe Bell House is a beloved Brooklyn music and comedy venue located at 149 7th St in the Gowanus neighborhood. Known for its warm atmosphere\, great sound\, and intimate setting\, The Bell House is one of NYC’s premier spots for live comedy and music events\, drawing top talent from around the country. \nTicket Information\nOfficial tickets are available through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are also available through VividSeats. Seating is general admission — arrive early for the best spots. Tickets are limited\, so don’t wait! \nOfficial Tickets \nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
