SUMMARY:Marc Maron: Yammering into the Void Tour LIVE at California Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Marc Maron\nMarc Maron is one of the most respected voices in stand-up comedy. The Brooklyn-born comedian\, actor\, and podcast host is best known for his groundbreaking WTF with Marc Maron podcast\, which has featured interviews with President Barack Obama and the biggest names in entertainment. \nMaron’s stand-up is deeply personal\, introspective\, and brutally honest. His comedy explores anxiety\, relationships\, addiction\, aging\, and the existential absurdity of modern life. His Yammering into the Void Tour promises his most candid and compelling material yet. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 22\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: California Theatre\, 345 S First St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nContent Warning: Adult language and themes\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe California Theatre is one of San Jose’s most beloved historic performance venues. Built in 1927\, this stunning Spanish Colonial Revival-style theater has been beautifully restored and seats approximately 1\,100 guests. It is operated by San Jose Theaters and is a designated San Jose landmark. \nThe intimate yet grand atmosphere of the California Theatre makes it an ideal setting for a comedian of Maron’s caliber. The venue features excellent acoustics\, comfortable seating\, and a beautiful interior. Located at 345 S First St in downtown San Jose\, it is easily accessible by public transit and nearby parking. \nWhat to Expect\nMarc Maron’s live shows are known for their intensity\, vulnerability\, and sharp comedic insight. Expect a full evening of stand-up that goes deep — Maron doesn’t shy away from difficult topics\, but always finds the humor in the darkness. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes. This is a must-see for fans of intelligent\, emotionally resonant comedy in one of San Jose’s most beautiful venues. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced from approximately $45 – $95 depending on seating and availability. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
