SUMMARY:Funny Marco LIVE at The Block at Harrah's Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nFunny Marco LIVE at The Block at Harrah’s Philadelphia\nGet ready for a night of nonstop laughs as internet sensation and comedian Funny Marco takes the stage at The Block at Harrah’s Philadelphia in Chester\, PA on August 22\, 2026. Known for his wild street interviews\, unpredictable humor\, and explosive energy\, Funny Marco delivers a live comedy experience you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 22\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open 60 minutes prior)\nVenue: The Block at Harrah’s Philadelphia\nAddress: 777 Harrah’s Blvd\, Chester\, PA 19013\nAge Requirement: Age restrictions may vary — see event page for details\nParking: Free parking available 24/7 at Harrah’s Philadelphia \nAbout Funny Marco\nFunny Marco is a viral comedian and content creator who rose to fame through his hilarious man-on-the-street interview videos. His unique ability to find comedy in everyday situations has earned him millions of followers and a devoted fanbase. Now he’s bringing his unfiltered\, high-energy style to the live stage for an unforgettable night of laughs. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWild\, unpredictable stand-up comedy from a viral internet sensation\nHigh-energy performance with crowd interaction\nA unique blend of street humor and storytelling\nCasino venue with full amenities and free parking\nAn unforgettable night of laughs near Philadelphia\nLimited tickets available — secure your seats early\n\nVenue Information\nThe Block at Harrah’s Philadelphia is an entertainment venue located at Harrah’s Philadelphia Casino & Racetrack in Chester\, PA\, just minutes from downtown Philadelphia. The venue offers free parking\, full casino amenities\, and an exciting atmosphere for live entertainment. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available now through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale marketplace). Average ticket price is approximately $59. There is an 8-ticket limit per person. Early arrival is advised. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
