SUMMARY:An Evening With Steve Treviño LIVE at Pavilion Theater at Tropicana Laughlin
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nAn Evening With Steve Treviño LIVE at Pavilion Theater at Tropicana Laughlin\nGet ready for a night of non-stop laughter as Steve Treviño brings his signature blend of family-friendly\, relatable comedy to the Pavilion Theater at Tropicana Laughlin on Saturday\, August 22\, 2026. Known for his hilarious takes on marriage\, family life\, and Latino culture\, Treviño delivers a show that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 22\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PDT\nVenue: Pavilion Theater at Tropicana Laughlin\nAddress: 2121 S Casino Dr\, Laughlin\, NV 89029\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome (18+ recommended for some content) \nAbout Steve Treviño\nSteve Treviño is a nationally touring stand-up comedian\, actor\, and writer best known for his Netflix and Comedy Central specials. His comedy draws from his Texas upbringing\, his marriage\, and the everyday hilarity of family life. He has built a massive following through his relatable storytelling and high-energy performances that leave audiences in stitches. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy performance\nHilarious stories about marriage and family life\nRelatable humor about Latino culture and everyday experiences\nAn intimate theater setting at the iconic Tropicana Laughlin\nA memorable night of laughs in a casino resort atmosphere\n\nVenue Information\nThe Pavilion Theater at Tropicana Laughlin is an intimate performance venue located inside the Tropicana Laughlin casino resort on the banks of the Colorado River. The venue offers excellent sightlines and a comfortable setting for live entertainment. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at approximately $82. Secure your seats early as this show is expected to sell out. Both official and resale tickets are available below. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
